---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Hero from "../../../components/Hero.astro";
import Figure from "../../../components/Figure.astro";
import Icon from "../../../components/Icon.astro";
import { withBase } from "../../../consts";
import heroImg from "../../../assets/photos/fuji-corvette-face-brouillard.jpg";
import fujimibashiCarteImg from "../../../assets/photos/fuji-fujimibashi-carte.webp";
import feuxArriereImg from "../../../assets/photos/fuji-fujimibashi-corvette-feux-arriere.jpg";

function mapsHref(query: string) {
  return `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`;
}

const agenceMapsHref = mapsHref("MFJ Rental Car&Motorbike, 996-21 Funatsu, Fujikawaguchiko");
const fujimibashiMapsHref = mapsHref("Fujimibashi Mount Fuji Viewing Platform");
---

<Layout
  title="MFJ Rental Cars"
  description="MFJ Rental Cars in Kawaguchiko: my rented Corvette C7, price, deposit, deductible, fuel and my review after a day on the roads around Mount Fuji."
>
  <Hero
    image={heroImg}
    eyebrow="Great spot · Mount Fuji"
    title="MFJ Rental Cars"
    subtitle="The agency that rented me a Corvette C7 Stingray in Kawaguchiko, to take on the mountain roads around the lake."
    focalPoint="22% 48%"
    zoom={1.1}
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <a
      href={withBase("/en/mount-fuji/")}
      class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink-soft"
    >
      <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      Back to Mount Fuji
    </a>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      A bit of context: before arriving at Mount Fuji, the weather forecast was looking pretty bad for catching a
      glimpse of it. So I wondered if there were any rental agencies in the area. My goal was simple: get a decent car
      to drive around the forest.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 font-body text-xs text-mist-500">Not sponsored: I paid for the rental myself.</p>

    <div class="reveal mt-8 space-y-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <p>
        On the train, a quick search on Google Maps around Kawaguchiko, and I stumble upon this agency by chance: MFJ
        Rental Cars. It doesn't look like much and also rents bikes... but I spot a Corvette and an Audi. On top of
        that, it has good reviews on Google.
      </p>
      <p>
        I don't think twice: I head to their website, the Corvette is on sale for 13,000 yen and you can book without
        paying. I'll grant you, it's not a JDM, but between an Audi A5 and the Corvette, the choice was easy. Off we go,
        see you tomorrow!
      </p>
      <p>
        The next day, I spot the Corvette in a simple parking lot next to a small restaurant. I push open the door of
        the agency, between bikes and cars, and meet the manager: incredibly kind. No deposit to pay, and like at every
        agency (I'll spare you the details), we sign a contract and walk around the car together. In case of an
        accident, the deductible is 50,000 yen. Needless to say, with a rear-wheel-drive beast like this one, you'd
        better keep a light foot.
      </p>
      <p>Once the engine is running, first stop: the Fuji Motor Sports Museum, right next to Fuji Speedway.</p>
    </div>

    <a
      href={withBase("/en/mount-fuji/fuji-motor-sports-museum/")}
      class="link-underline reveal mt-4 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
    >
      Discover the Fuji Motor Sports Museum
      <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
    </a>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      Even though the weather clearly wasn't on my side that day, I drove around the track and climbed the mountain in
      this truly incredible car. Here's a clip that should win everyone over:
    </p>

    <figure class="reveal mt-6">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-asphalt">
        <video
          src={withBase("/videos/fuji-mfj-pov-route-montagne.mp4")}
          poster={withBase("/videos/fuji-mfj-pov-poster.jpg")}
          width="1920"
          height="1080"
          controls
          preload="metadata"
          playsinline
          class="w-full"
        />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mt-2 font-body text-xs text-mist-500">
        A few seconds on board the Corvette, on the mountain roads around Mount Fuji.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/50 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8">
      <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-3xl">Last stop: Fujimibashi</h2>

      <p class="reveal mt-6 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Before returning the car, I couldn't resist one last drive in the mountains. Destination: the Fujimibashi
        Mount Fuji Viewing Platform, a lookout perched on Route 137, which climbs above Lake Kawaguchi.
      </p>

      <Figure
        image={fujimibashiCarteImg}
        alt="Google Maps map showing the Fujimibashi viewpoint on Route 137, north of Lake Kawaguchi and Fujikawaguchiko"
        caption="The Fujimibashi viewpoint, on Route 137 north of Lake Kawaguchi. Google Maps screenshot."
        class="mt-8"
      />
      <a
        href={fujimibashiMapsHref}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="link-underline reveal mt-3 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
      >
        Open in Google Maps
        <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
      </a>

      <p class="reveal mt-8 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        That day, the fog had taken over: no Mount Fuji on the horizon, but the perfect mood for photos. That's actually
        where the photo at the top of this page was taken.
      </p>

      <Figure
        image={feuxArriereImg}
        alt="White Corvette C7 Stingray seen from behind, lights on, in the fog at the Fujimibashi viewpoint"
        caption="Taillights on in the Fujimibashi fog."
        class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm"
        aspectClass="aspect-[3/4]"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="reveal font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-3xl">My verdict</h2>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 space-y-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <p>
        The experience was absolutely amazing! The rumble of the American V8 is enough to make you want to turn off the
        radio. The torque is huge, but in the rain, no way to make the most of it: I played it safe. And that dark,
        misty weather gave the drive real charm. Even without Mount Fuji, it'll remain an incredible experience.
      </p>
      <p>In the evening, I returned the car without any problem.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 rounded-lg border border-racing-500/30 bg-racing-500/5 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-2 text-racing-500">
        <Icon name="fuel" class="h-4 w-4" />
        Important: fuel
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Filling up isn't your job, the agency takes care of it. However, it charges for gas at <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">120 yen per liter</strong>,
        a little way to round up the bill. The calculation is based on the kilometers driven, with a <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">baseline of 20 L/100 km</strong>.
        If you drive economically, like I did, you lose out: you pay for more than you actually used. On the other hand,
        if you have a heavy foot and go over that reference consumption, you come out ahead.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mt-6 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      I didn't find this practice very honest, but luckily the rental price was very low. I assume the promo is down to
      September, rainy and quieter in terms of tourism. Yet a month later, it was still listed. For €72 a rental, we'll
      turn a blind eye to the gas… :)
    </p>

    <h2 class="reveal mt-16 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-3xl">Practical info</h2>

    <div class="reveal mt-6 rounded-lg border border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/40 p-5">
      <p class="eyebrow text-racing-500">Car rental · Kawaguchiko</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-body text-sm font-semibold text-ink">MFJ Rental Cars</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
        <li>Corvette C7 Stingray: 13,000 yen, about €72 (promo rate when I booked)</li>
        <li>Day rental, from 9 a.m. to 8:30 p.m. at the latest (several days possible on request)</li>
        <li>Minimum age: 21</li>
        <li>
          License: official Japanese translation of your license or International Driving Permit, depending on your
          country (more details in our guide <a href={withBase("/en/driving-in-japan/")} class="link-underline text-ink">Driving in Japan</a>)
        </li>
        <li>Book on their website, nothing to pay in advance</li>
        <li>No deposit required</li>
        <li>50,000 yen deductible in case of an accident</li>
        <li>Fuel handled by the agency: 120 yen per liter, based on 20 L/100 km</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-1.5 font-body text-sm text-ink-soft">
        <Icon name="map-pin" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-mist-500" />
        996-21 Funatsu, Fujikawaguchiko, Yamanashi 401-0301, Japan
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
        <a
          href={agenceMapsHref}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link-underline inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
        >
          Open in Google Maps
          <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://mfj-car.com/en/index.html"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="link-underline inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-racing-500"
        >
          Agency website
          <Icon name="external-link" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-mist-200 bg-paper-dim/50 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center sm:px-8">
      <a
        href={withBase("/en/mount-fuji/")}
        class="link-underline reveal inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-ink"
      >
        <Icon name="arrow-left" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        Back to all Mount Fuji spots
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
